        "Content": "RAY COOKE LETTINGS ADVERTISE PROPERTIES ON FACEBOOK & INSTAGRAM FIRST SO PLEASE MAKE SURE YOU ARE FOLLOWING US THERE VIDEO VIEWINGS AVAILABLE ON REQUEST\nRAY COOKE LETTINGS are delighted to present this gorgeous, fully furnished 2 Bed / 1 Bath apartment to the rental market, situated in the heart of Bray town centre on Castle Street, Bray, Co. Wicklow.\nThe property comprises of a bright and spacious living room, a well-fitted kitchen/dining area with integrated appliances including oven, hob and washing machine, and a fully tiled bathroom with walk-in shower. There are two well-proportioned bedrooms, and the property also benefits from a separate utility area.\nIn terms of location, Castle Street is right at the centre of Bray. Castle Street Shopping Centre is directly opposite, with a wide range of shops, cafés and everyday services on the doorstep. Bray's iconic Victorian seafront promenade — lined with some of the best restaurants, bars and coffee shops in Co. Wicklow — is just a short walk away, as is the famous Bray Head Cliff Walk. Killruddery House and Gardens, Sea Life Bray and the Wicklow Mountains are all within easy reach.\nFor transport, Bray DART Station is just minutes from the property, providing a direct link into Dublin city centre. Dublin Bus links are also right outside the apartment and the N11 and M50 are easily accessible by car.\nFeatures:\n<ol>\n <li>Fully Furnished</li>\n <li>2 Spacious Bedrooms</li>\n <li>Bathroom with Walk-In Shower</li>\n <li>Fitted Kitchen with Integrated Appliances</li>\n <li>Highly Sought-After Location</li>\n <li>Prime Town Centre Location</li>\n <li>Bray Seafront & Promenade Within Walking Distance</li>\n <li>Bray DART Station Minutes Away</li>\n <li>N11 / M50 Easily Accessible</li>\n <li>Available Immediately</li>\n</ol>\nViewing Highly Advised!\nRAY COOKE LETTINGS EMAIL ENQUIRIES ONLY / NO PHONE CALLS PLEASE FILL IN YOUR CONTACT INFORMATION ON THE RIGHT-HAND SIDE AND CLICK SEND MESSAGE WE WILL CONTACT YOU WITH VIEWING DETAILS WHEN THEY ARISE\n"
